      "writtenOn": "2026-03-25T10:08:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Based on [texel-buffers proposal](https://github.com/gpuweb/gpuweb/blob/5ce21beb8e03644535b2cb8730546fd508c73e47/proposals/texel-buffers.md#vulkan) uniform texel buffers may want to be supported.",
